# Balemurk Leech with Roaring Furnace // Steaming Sauna: the Room entering is an enchantment entering, so Bot2 loses 1 (20 ->
# 19, once: entering with one door unlocked is not also fully unlocking, CR 709.5). Unlocking its other door in turn 3 fully
# unlocks it ("whenever you fully unlock a Room", the 2024-09-20 ruling): 1 more (19 -> 18). The Room is cast after the Leech
# is on the battlefield, so the entering counts.

